Publisher icons

Each file is the website icon (favicon, touch icon or site logo mark) that the
publisher or platform serves on its own website, trimmed and resized to 64 px.
They are shown only to identify who published a source in the Library. The
names and marks are trademarks of their owners; no endorsement is implied.

